        "layout": "story",
        "eyebrow": "THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE PRODUCT",
        "heading": "Made with purpose.\nAnd a soundtrack.",
        "body": "Corey Goss started making deodorants in his kitchen in 2020. His standard: performance, skin feel, thoughtful packaging and fair pricing.",
        "image_alt": "BPM beside a turntable",
        "button_label": "Meet BPM"
      }
    },
